1
00:00:00,559 --> 00:00:03,189
(Sheldon:)Am I correct in assuming
that your attempt...

2
00:00:03,354 --> 00:00:07,564
(Sheldon:)...to be accepted by Penny's peers
is based on your desire to ensure...

3
00:00:07,733 --> 00:00:10,773
(Sheldon:)...your continuing mating privileges
with her?

4
00:00:12,363 --> 00:00:14,903
(Leonard:)Well, I wouldn't put it
exactly that way.

5
00:00:15,074 --> 00:00:16,154
(Sheldon:)How would you put it?

6
00:00:17,493 --> 00:00:19,573
(Leonard:)Yeah, okay, like you said.

7
00:00:20,663 --> 00:00:25,253
(Sheldon:)Huh. Seems like an awful lot of trouble
to go through for intercourse.

8
00:00:26,127 --> 00:00:29,467
(Sheldon:)Don't you have access to women
who will do it for money?

9
00:00:32,425 --> 00:00:37,095
(Sheldon:)By the way, another accepted usage
for the term "ho."

10
00:00:39,140 --> 00:00:40,350
(Leonard:)Goodbye, Sheldon.

11
00:00:41,267 --> 00:00:42,557
Now, hold on.

12
00:00:42,727 --> 00:00:46,067
(Sheldon:)I believe that social convention dictate
you not arrive empty-handed.

13
00:00:46,230 --> 00:00:48,860
(Sheldon:)Would you like to bring
some Cylon toast?

14
00:00:49,358 --> 00:00:53,158
(Leonard:)Yeah, no, I'm trying to fit in,
not get laughed at.

15
00:00:56,699 --> 00:01:01,019
(Sheldon:)What's funny about Cylon toast?

